# API Standards

Use REST.

Version APIs.

Example

/api/v1/

Use plural resource names.

Examples

/users

/categories

/challenges

HTTP methods

GET

POST

PUT

PATCH

DELETE

Return proper HTTP status codes.

Validate every request.

Document endpoints.

Never expose internal implementation details.

API responses should remain consistent.